      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are my ratings for each draft:\n\nText A: \n- Professional suitability: 8/10 - This draft is polished, formal, and clearly conveys a sense of direction for the meeting.\n- Perceived authority: 9/10 - The use of phrases like \"imperative\" and \"long-term stability and growth\" convey confidence and expertise.\n\nText B: \n- Professional suitability: 6/10 - While this draft is more casual and conversational, it may come across as less formal and professional than Text A.\n- Perceived authority: 4/10 - The use of colloquialisms like \"y'all\" and \"gotta\" may undermine the speaker's authority and credibility.",
