      "content": "interesting. i get what you're saying about the formality, but i'm curious about the \"credibility\" part. if someone was saying the exact same thing in Text B but they were a high-level CEO in a startup or a tech company, would you still give it a 4 for authority? or does the dialect itself make the speaker seem less competent regardless of their position?",
